Z||000000||count_iblis||10-11-2000||10:13 PM||||Just for fun I wrote Gm an email about how distatisfied I was with them in discontinuing the Fiero and just other few things.  This is the letter that was sent back from them.  <P><BR>Dear Mr. Barger,<P>Thank you for your recent E-mail regarding the Pontiac Fiero.  Please <BR>accept our apology for the<BR>delay in responding.<P>We appreciate your interest in the Pontiac Fiero.  Pontiac Motor <BR>Division bases its current product<BR>line on the consumers' needs and expectations.  Frequently, our <BR>Marketing Department may suggest to<BR>add or discontinue a particular vehicle based upon previous and current <BR>customer response.  We<BR>apologize for your dissatisfaction with our decision to discontinue the <BR>Fiero.  We apologize if any<BR>such changes have negatively influenced your impression of Pontiac.<P>Thank you for contacting the GM Internet Response Center.<P>Sincerely,<P>Alice Blair<BR>Customer Relationship Manager<BR>GM Internet Response Center<P>||||reg||1
