Z||000003||Tigger||10-12-2000||12:17 AM||||Cooter, don't even go there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Hey, have you guys seen the new Saturn SUV unveiling?  They have a picture of it on the <A HREF="http://www.saturnbp.com/index.jhtml" TARGET=_blank>Saturn page</A>.  Look for the <B>Saturn SUV Unveiled in Miami</B> link.  It's not the best looking SUV but it does have a nicer look than the Aztek and it has plastic side body panels.<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">          <BR> <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||4
