Z||000005||Cheever2||10-12-2000||02:18 AM||||Yeah, it looks good, but I'm getting real tired of the spinning-car advertisements.  It was a long time before they finally showed what the dang vehicle looks like.  And what's that in the back, a cooler of human organs?  Well, it's all strapped down, guess that's supposed to be impressive like the cargo in a FedEx airplane or something.  Anyway yes it looks good, but you KNOW it's going to be overpriced.  At least there won't be any haggling over the cost though (does Saturn still have that no haggle policy?).  I still like the Xterra.  But mostly I miss my Scout SSII.<P>Editing because I forgot to thank the Count for writing to GM on our behalf, and for sharing their response with us.  Wudda liked ta seen your original email however.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 10-12-2000).]||||reg||13
